OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer guilty of series of
OL,4,Arapes and sex attacks over 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Police Scotland officer has
OL,7,Fbeen convicted of a catalogue of sex
OL,8,Fcrimes, including two counts of rape,
OL,9,Fover a 17-year period.
OL,11,FCampbell Petrie, 50, was found guilty
OL,12,Fof nine charges involving physical and
OL,13,Fsexual abuse towards two women between
OL,14,F2006 and 2023 at the High Court in
OL,15,FGlasgow.
OL,17,FPetrie, who was a serving officer at
OL,18,Fthe time of the offences, was initially
OL,19,Farrested in 2009 following allegations
OL,20,Fmade by one of the women but was
OL,21,Freleased after five hours and remained
OL,22,Fin his police role.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
