OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer guilty of series of
OL,4,Arapes and sex attacks over 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force confirmed he was arrested,
OL,7,Fcharged and suspended from duty in
OL,8,FDecember 2023. He retired from the
OL,9,Fforce in December last year.
